Customer benefit
Originating Institutions (OIs) and Receiving Institutions (RIs) and issuers
may benefit from faster and more efficient funds return and increased
end-user trust resulting in an enhanced end-to-end customer experience.
NOTE: For the purpose of message flows, the Receiving Institution
acts in the issuer role in the relevant reversal messages.
What Mastercard is doing
Mastercard is enabling RIs to return funds to OIs for approved
MoneySend Payment and Gaming Payment Transactions through
reversal messages when those funds cannot be retained due to
regulatory, compliance, fraud, or operational reasons. Mastercard is
introducing a new message reason code to support the RI-initiated
reversal processes.
NOTE: The new messages are not applicable for domestic South Africa
transactions.
