Background
RIs that accept Mastercard MoneySend and Gaming Payment Transactions may need to return funds after
authorization due to compliance, risk, or regulatory concerns. Currently, the system does not support an
automated return mechanism. RIs must rely on a manual, non‑scalable Form 1268 process, and chargebacks
cannot be used under Mastercard Rules. Mastercard acknowledges RIs concerns related to operational cost and
risk and is taking steps to help mitigate these impacts.
