OI: Mandated
OIs globally participating in Mastercard MoneySend Payment Transactions and Gaming Payment Transactions
must be prepared to receive in the Dual Message Clearing System:
• Message reason code 4351 (Reversal – RI Initiated Funds Return) in Data Element (DE) 25 (Message Reason
Code) for First Chargeback (Full)/1442-450 messages
• Clearing message reason indicator codes RI01 to RI25 in DE 72 (Data Record) for First Chargeback (Full)/
1442-450 messages
OIs globally participating in Mastercard MoneySend Payment Transactions and Gaming Payment Transactions
must be prepared to receive in the Single Message System:
• Advice reason code 489 (Chargeback) in DE60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 1 (Advice Reason Code) in
Issuer Reversal Advice/0422
• Message reason code 0051 (Reversal – RI Initiated Funds Return) in DE 60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 2
(Advice Reason Code) in Issuer Reversal Advice/0422 messages
• Message reason indicator codes RI01 to RI25 in DE 60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 3 (Advice Reason
Details Text) in Issuer Reversal Advice/0422 messages
OIs and RIs must be aware of Integrated Product Message (IPM) Mastercard Parameter Extract (MPE) changes
as described in this release announcement.
RI: Optional
RIs globally participating in Mastercard MoneySend Payment Transactions and Gaming Payment Transactions
must be aware that they may populate the following codes in the Dual Message Clearing System:
• Message reason code 4351 (Reversal – RI Initiated Funds Return) in Data Element (DE) 25 (Message Reason
Code) for First Chargeback (Full)/1442-450 messages
• Clearing message reason indicator codes RI01 to RI25 in DE 72 (Data Record) for First Chargeback (Full)/
1442-450 messages
RIs globally participating in Mastercard MoneySend Payment Transactions and Gaming Payment Transactions
must be aware that they may populate the following codes in the Single Message System:
• Advice reason code 489 (Chargeback) in DE60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 1 (Advice Reason Code) in
Issuer Reversal Advice/0422
• Message reason code 0051 (Reversal – RI Initiated Funds Return) in DE 60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 2
(Advice Reason Code) in Issuer Reversal Advice/0422 messages
• Message reason indicator codes RI01 to RI25 in DE 60 (Advice Reason Code), subfield 3 (Advice Reason
Details Text) in Issuer Reversal Advice/0422 messages
